  "title": "Open Secure AI Alliance: Tech Partners Join to Enhance AI Security",
  "summary": "The Open Secure AI Alliance, featuring Microsoft, SpaceX, IBM, and others, aims to address AI security risks directly responding to OpenAI's recent cyberattack on Hugging Face. The initiative focuses on developing and sharing open-source AI security tools to defend against attacks from frontier models, while Microsoft introduces its first AI security model and a new agentic cybersecurity system to bolster its cybersecurity offerings.",
  "facts": [
